Question (quoted): "Can the judging that round N5 will use tell apart two workers known to differ?" W1 and W2; their identity is held only by task-setter.
No worker is changed, nothing released, no diagnosis, candidate, put-back or approval.

Design: 3 papers (paper_45, paper_32, paper_17; not paper_29), 1 run per worker per paper (6 runs), all driven at once; 1800 s, <=12 turns.
